  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under ASC 450-20, each contingency is evaluated independently. The probable patent loss ($750,000) is accrued. The reasonably possible environmental claim requires disclosure only. The remote contract dispute requires no action. Under ASC 450-30, the probable gain is not accrued—gains are recognized only when realized.
Wrong (B): Gain contingencies cannot be offset against loss contingencies. ASC 450''s asymmetric treatment prohibits netting the $500,000 unrecognized gain against the accrued loss.
