-- Q11712: Contingencies [medium/L3]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under ASC 450-20 and ASC 270-10-45, contingencies in interim periods are evaluated using the same ASC 450 criteria at each interim date. When the revised estimate indicates a higher probable loss, the incremental $350,000 is recognized in the period the estimate changes, bringing the total accrual to $950,000.
